      "congressionalglo7392unit:397:par_000397_000019": {
        "text": "Mr. Chairman, why do we not have a spe- cial tariff between the United States and the island of Cuba? That may be claimed with the same urgency as a special tariff for the Canadas. The Canadas are upon our borders. The island of Cuba is not a great distance from the coast of Florida or the coast of Louisiana. Why not, then, have a special tariff for Cuba, or for any other portion of the world with which we have trade?",
